{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063084/block/singleImage/3263560/wm/01M72SRQYTD4JHYFHJ2R7BFD1F.jpeg?updatedAt=1794316805\"/><figcaption>會德豐黃光耀生日將至 一眾銷售部員工齊聚慶祝</figcaption></figure><p>會德豐地產副主席兼常務董事黃光耀 (Ricky) 生日將至，一眾銷售部員工今日 (10 日 ) 為他慶祝生日，眾人齊聚一堂，場面熱鬧。 Ricky 感謝員工一直以來的支持與努力，並送上生日願望：「祝大家身體健康、日日爆數，攜手再創佳績！」 會德豐地產早前公布今年暫已售出 2,527 伙，連同車位，總銷售金額達 302 億元，超越去年全年 265 億元銷售金額及 2,307 伙累售成績。 會德豐首10個月銷售金額302億創高峰｜新盤市況</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T14:41:56.026378+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":242,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T13:20:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:34:39.696762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:35:21.231002+00:00","content_hash":"e95180bcfe1ddff0b0a1d27f2818c7426600de1937b19917fa1900bd99592808","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T14:41:56.026378+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}